    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/543774857970183b640d06f0f10b3726.poster.avif?t=1752518840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/543774857970183b640d06f0f10b3726.webm?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/543774857970183b640d06f0f10b3726.mp4?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>They are hunting you down.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/05185b6fe2ab4742d1f2b0e844d4f2c2.poster.avif?t=1752518840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/05185b6fe2ab4742d1f2b0e844d4f2c2.webm?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/05185b6fe2ab4742d1f2b0e844d4f2c2.mp4?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your smart guns to fend them off.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/651161e583978a40fc19657deaad8d3c.poster.avif?t=1752518840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/651161e583978a40fc19657deaad8d3c.webm?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/651161e583978a40fc19657deaad8d3c.mp4?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive your hover truck around a violent, bizarre city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/88799724a93565aa4fc4b60730fc1249.poster.avif?t=1752518840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/88799724a93565aa4fc4b60730fc1249.webm?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/88799724a93565aa4fc4b60730fc1249.mp4?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat it up with entertaining characters. Hang out in a mansion or a space ship.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong>: Play as a jobless tech worker entangled in a surreal journey with Brunilda, the game designer whose projects have made her the target of a secret society. As her protector, you\u2019ll navigate a decaying city overrun by cybernetic enemies, fragmented memories, and shifting realities. The mysterious forces controlling North Terrace may be impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sound &amp; Voice Acting</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a haunting original soundtrack and voice-acted dialogue that brings the world and its characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Puzzles &amp; Cryptic Messages</strong> \u2013 Uncover secret paths and decipher clues that pull you deeper into the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memo &amp; Inventory System</strong> \u2013 Collect memos, essential equipment, and key items to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/543774857970183b640d06f0f10b3726.poster.avif?t=1752518840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/543774857970183b640d06f0f10b3726.webm?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/543774857970183b640d06f0f10b3726.mp4?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>They are hunting you down.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/05185b6fe2ab4742d1f2b0e844d4f2c2.poster.avif?t=1752518840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/05185b6fe2ab4742d1f2b0e844d4f2c2.webm?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/05185b6fe2ab4742d1f2b0e844d4f2c2.mp4?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your smart guns to fend them off.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/651161e583978a40fc19657deaad8d3c.poster.avif?t=1752518840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/651161e583978a40fc19657deaad8d3c.webm?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/651161e583978a40fc19657deaad8d3c.mp4?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive your hover truck around a violent, bizarre city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/88799724a93565aa4fc4b60730fc1249.poster.avif?t=1752518840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/88799724a93565aa4fc4b60730fc1249.webm?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2293640/extras/88799724a93565aa4fc4b60730fc1249.mp4?t=1752518840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat it up with entertaining characters. Hang out in a mansion or a space ship.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong>: Play as a jobless tech worker entangled in a surreal journey with Brunilda, the game designer whose projects have made her the target of a secret society. As her protector, you\u2019ll navigate a decaying city overrun by cybernetic enemies, fragmented memories, and shifting realities. The mysterious forces controlling North Terrace may be impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sound &amp; Voice Acting</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a haunting original soundtrack and voice-acted dialogue that brings the world and its characters to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Puzzles &amp; Cryptic Messages</strong> \u2013 Uncover secret paths and decipher clues that pull you deeper into the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memo &amp; Inventory System</strong> \u2013 Collect memos, essential equipment, and key items to aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Narrative Driven Psychological Horror. Your therapist sets you up on a date with the enigmatic Brunilda. You find out that she\u2019s being hunted by a secret society. Upgrade your weapons, battle cybernetic enemies, and search for secrets in a futuristic town filled with mysterious, alluring characters.",
